WEBVTT

00:05:59.929 --> 00:06:01.833
This was a radical breakthrough

00:06:01.857 --> 00:06:05.135
that makes gene editing
massively easier --

00:06:05.159 --> 00:06:08.313
so easy that CRISPR
is now taught in high schools.

00:06:08.825 --> 00:06:12.125
And this stuff is moving
quicker than computing.

00:06:12.149 --> 00:06:15.260
That slow, stodgy white line up there?

00:06:15.284 --> 00:06:17.542
That's Moore's law.

00:06:17.566 --> 00:06:21.346
That shows us how quickly
computing is getting cheaper.

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:24.403
That steep, crazy-fun green line,

00:06:24.427 --> 00:06:28.491
that shows us how quickly
genetic sequencing is getting cheaper.

00:06:28.515 --> 00:06:32.113
Now, gene editing
and synthesis and sequencing,